 pour zoomer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1UfeikxIQ3cQ7kNvwFpcdW-&_nc_oc=Adrdt-3Xob75NJFd5aOTrVgNBBnx60_2MNAzu17eKDTFIdf6ZEFYnq7yixadgOYQqd8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af88qBs_qUFpS64TYqpF3Cc0mGClcjmA5llhFaSscDoecQ&oe=6A36B034"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SX0v0y5KisUQ7kNvwEEyZ5L&_nc_oc=AdqY0oVtT67Qz_t_E7M0MCPaRlySgTIeRcfjzaHBBjGP2KKtR-DLuwGwfW7AFzdRa8Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8DR0bKgc2nEBc8FizeKe_Hfr_kbdjh06BoBW__KcDlnQ&oe=6A36B196"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wX_G_Mg3fYsQ7kNvwEAxN30&_nc_oc=Adq3fRLQvsgLorfUEgFtRUHddn62QRgu5aakCyuAkacwCWvSjcM2XBEwk2xDs3wvEvw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9nAX48BtkUlPQmF8T2JW5xrXS6yQCJK5CPb_BMDcbIJA&oe=6A368E77"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "